<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish electronics firm in 11 mln punt investment.</title>
<headline>Irish electronics firm in 11 mln punt investment.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silicon &amp; Software Systems, a subsidiary of Philips Electronics BV, on Monday announced an 11 million punt investment programme.</p>
<p>The project will create 110 new jobs over the next three years and bring total employment at the firm to 300, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Silicon &amp; Software Systems specialises in the design of silicon chips, software and hardware for many of the world's leading multinational companies.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
